<title>ITALY: Italy offers 2.0 trln lire of BOTs for sale.</title>
<headline>Italy offers 2.0 trln lire of BOTs for sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian treasury said it was offering 2.0 trillion lire of two-year zero couponed certificates (CTZ) for sale.</p>
<p>Subscriptions for the auction close at 1200 GMT, December 23.</p>
</text>
